<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vēnālīcĭus</span></b> 
		or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-tĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		venalis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			selling</i>, <i>for sale.</i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jumenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 76</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vēnālīcĭum</span></b> ,
				ii, n., <i>taxes on
			sales</i>, <i><span class="en">Cod. Just. 12, 19,
			4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			In partic., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
				slave-selling.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">familiae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>young slaves exposed for sale</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 42</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">greges,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					35, 18, 58, § 201</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Substt.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vēnālīcĭus</span></b> ,
				ii, m., <i>a
			slave-dealer</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Or. 70, 232</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 21,
				26, 97, § 170</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet. Rhet.
			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vēnā-līcĭum</span></b> ,
				ii, n.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>a.</b>
			<i>Slave-selling</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 21,
				1, 65</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Petr. 29</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 3023</span></i> and
			4777.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>Plur.</i>, concr., <i>young
			slaves</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 28, 8, 5</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
